<title>USA: Ames Nov same-store sales up 1 pct.</title>
<headline>Ames Nov same-store sales up 1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKY HILL, CONN. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $223.0     $218.2	 2.2	  1.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $1,678     $1,658	 1.2	  0.3</p>
<p>Same-store sales for the month were $208.8 million compared with $206.7 million a year earlier. Same-store sales for the year-to-date were $1,571 compared with 1,576 a year earlier.</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is Nov weeks ended Nov. 23</p>
<p>    Full company name is Ames Department Stores Inc</p>
</text>
